title: An added line is staged alone while four lines added above it stay unstaged; committed and the rest discarded, the line must sit after "line 8" (index check: git show :insert.txt)
folders: git-shifted
expect-file: git-shifted/insert.txt :: ^line 1\n[\s\S]*line 8\ninserted\nline 9\n[\s\S]*line 12\n$
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto insert.txt
wait 1000
part stage insert.txt 13
wait 1500
mark staged
wait 600
git commit only the inserted line
wait 1500
git discard insert.txt
wait 500
answer Discard
wait 1500
mark end
wait 600
quit
